oxel world. Players create a character, choose one of four vocations (warrior, archer, mage or druid) and descend alone or in a party into crypts whose floors are generated on every run, fighting creatures and bosses for experience and loot. Besides the level, every character has five skills (magic level, light weapons, heavy weapons, distance and shielding) that only improve with use. In town, players meet at the tavern, form parties, sell loot to NPC shops and trade items with each other.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cryptward-online", "videos": [{"id": 199213, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "Ebb1xlfD57U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ebb1xlfD57U", "title": "Cryptward Online \u2014 Trailer Oficial", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ebb1xlfD57U/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}